  {
    "id": 3002007010020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『もしもし』……うさぎさんは電話を取ります\r\n『やぁ、カメさん久しぶり』",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "カメさんと話すのが楽しく、うさぎさんは\r\n自転車に乗ったまま、夢中でお話を続けていました",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "すると──\r\n『キキーッ！　ドンッ！』",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_cheat",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "角を曲がってくる相手に気付かず、\r\nうさぎさんは自転車でぶつかってしまったのです……",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『だ、大丈夫ですか！』そばへ寄ってみると、\r\n倒れて大ケガをしていたのは、なんとカメさんでした",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『カメさん！　カメさん！\r\n……ああ、電話なんてしなければよかった……！』",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_cheat",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "うさぎさんはわんわんと泣きながら、\r\nすぐに救急車を呼ぶのでした……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……みなさんはどうですか？\r\n電話やよそ見をしながら運転するのはとても危険です",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010090"
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "十分に注意して、自転車に乗りましょう\r\n……おしまい",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300200701/3002007010100"
  },
  {
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 796,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 2
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3002007010110,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
